  "notes": [
   "Areas of specialization: 'Plus a minimum of 20 units from one of the following areas of specialization, including at least 3 units of Engineering courses listed in that area.' The printed 'Units: 20.0- 22.0' belongs to the specialization choice as a whole; it is recorded as stated on each area block.",
